eslint-scope-go
===============

A Go port of eslint-scope (eslint-scope 7.2.2).

The upstream package is vendored under the parity oracle directory
(`oracle/` or `original/`) and is used at test time to check this port's
behaviour. Its licence is reproduced in LICENSE. Only the Go code in this
repository is the port work; the upstream package remains the work of its
own authors.
